    "Name": "Scarabus SCB-9A",
    "Details": "The Scarabus is equipped with a close range weapons arsenal, with the primary weapons being a pair of medium lasers backed up by a pair of small lasers. To defend itself when the 'Mech gets into extremely close range combat, the Scarabus carries a two ton hatchet, which allows it to cleave into an enemy's armor. The 'Mech is also equipped with a Guardian ECM suite to protect itself from advanced electronic detection equipment when scouting against an enemy, and mounts a TAG to designate targets for Arrow IV artillery attacks.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
